<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fun Facts</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .facts-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .fact-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .fact-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .fact-card h2 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.3em;
        }

        .fact-card p {
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }

        .fact-emoji {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🌟 Fun Facts 🌟</h1>
        
        <div class="facts-grid">
            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🐙</div>
                <h2>Octopus Intelligence</h2>
                <p>Octopuses have nine brains—one central brain and a mini brain in each of their eight arms. Each arm can solve problems independently!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🦁</div>
                <h2>Lion's Roar</h2>
                <p>A lion's roar can be heard from 5 miles away and is used to communicate with pride members and warn intruders to stay away.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🍯</div>
                <h2>Honey Never Expires</h2>
                <p>Honey is the only food that never spoils. Archaeologists have found 3,000-year-old honey in Egyptian tombs that was still perfectly edible!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🌍</div>
                <h2>Venus Rotation</h2>
                <p>Venus rotates backward compared to most planets and spins so slowly that a day on Venus is longer than its year!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🧠</div>
                <h2>Brain Power</h2>
                <p>Your brain uses about 20% of your body's energy while making up only 2% of your body weight. It's incredibly powerful!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🦋</div>
                <h2>Butterfly Taste</h2>
                <p>Butterflies taste with their feet! They land on plants to check if they're good to eat or lay eggs on.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">⚡</div>
                <h2>Lightning Speed</h2>
                <p>Lightning is 5 times hotter than the surface of the sun! It can heat the air around it to 54,000 degrees Fahrenheit.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🐧</div>
                <h2>Penguin Social Life</h2>
                <p>Emperor penguins can hold their breath for up to 20 minutes and dive to depths of over 1,800 feet to find fish.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-emoji">🌙</div>
                <h2>Moon Facts</h2>
                <p>The Moon is slowly drifting away from Earth at about 1.5 inches per year, and it's been doing this for billions of years!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
